      en: ["Present building constructed 1960–1961", "Designed by the architect Gino Zani", "Architectural style is Neo-Romanesque", "Replaced a former 16th-century church", "Focal point of the Castello di Chiesanuova", "Facade built using locally sourced stone"],
      es: ["Un ancla religiosa en Chiesanuova.", "Arquitectura sencilla pero hermosa.", "Centro de la vida comunitaria."],
