      en: ["The museum was officially established in 1950 to showcase national sovereignty.", "San Marino's first national coin was a 5-centesimi copper piece minted in 1864.", "The republic issued its first official postage stamps on August 1, 1877.", "It houses a complete collection of gold Scudo coins minted during the 20th century.", "The museum is located within the historic Palazzo Pergami-Belluzzi since recent renovations.", "San Marino holds a special agreement with the EU to mint its own national Euro coins."],
